</section>


    <!-- =========================
        COMPANY HISTORY SECTION
========================= -->

  

<section class="company-history container-fluid py-5">

    <div class="row align-items-center g-5 px-3 px-md-5">

        <!-- LEFT IMAGE -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12">

            <div class="history-left text-center">
                <img src="/img/history.jpg" class="img-fluid " alt="Company History">
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- RIGHT CONTENT -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12">

            <div class="history-right">

                <span class="text-uppercase text-warning fw-bold">
                    Our Journey
                </span>

                <h2 class="mb-4">
                    Company History
                </h2>

                <!-- INTRO -->
                <p>
                    Virtual White Flame PVT. LTD. is a leading manufacturer of biomass briquettes and pellets
                    covering major regions of India. The company was established in 2013 as Seva Bio Brikets.
                </p>

                <p>
                    In 2017, to meet growing market demand and improve customer service,
                    Virtual White Flame PVT. LTD. was established.
                </p>

                <!-- DIVIDER -->
                <hr class="my-4">

                <!-- DETAILS -->
                <p>
                    We specialize in sustainable energy solutions by utilizing renewable resources and reducing carbon emissions.
                    Our focus is on quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction to support cleaner energy alternatives.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We are committed to combating climate change by producing high-quality biomass briquettes and pellets
                    as a replacement for fossil fuels, offering efficient eco-friendly energy solutions.
                </p>

                <p>
                    With strong commitment to sustainability and innovation, we aim to create a cleaner and greener future.
                    Partner with us for renewable energy solutions and long-term environmental impact.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>



