                <h3>Sustainable Energy Vision</h3>

                <p>
                    We recognize the demand for renewable energy sources to combat climate change
                    and promote sustainable development.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We are dedicated to producing high-quality biomass briquettes and pellets
                    to replace fossil fuels.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- BOX 3 (FULL WIDTH - 12 col) -->
        <div class="col-12">

            <div class="history-detail-box full-width h-100">

                <div class="history-icon">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-earth-asia"></i>
                </div>

                <h3>Commitment Towards Green Future</h3>

                <p>
                    Virtual White Flame PVT. LTD. is a trusted manufacturer of biomass briquettes and biomass pellets,
                    providing sustainable energy solutions for diverse industries and applications.
                </p>

                <p>
                    With our commitment to quality, innovation, and environmental responsibility,
                    we aim to build a cleaner and greener future.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Partner with us to embrace renewable energy and make a positive impact on the world.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


